            <ArticleTitle>In cholesterol lowering, moderation kills.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>560-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The high-fat American diet is responsible for an epidemic of coronary artery disease. A plant-based diet with less than 10% fat will prevent coronary disease from developing, halt the progress of existing disease, and even reverse the disease in many patients. Given proper support and education, motivated patients with a history of coronary disease can follow this diet and prevent future cardiac events.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
